The following validations have to be passed before a valid voucher posting is successfully created. The same set of validations will apply for both options: i.e., Manual Posting and Bulk Upload. 

Balancing Rule – all the voucher entries must have matching total debits and total credits for every following groups. 

Branch-Currency-NormalCGL 

Branch-Currency-MemoCGL 

# CGL starts with 5 are considered as Memo CGL, and rest of the CGL’s are treated as Normal CGL. 

Master Validations - Branch, Currency and CGL must exist and be active in the respective masters. 

Branch – up to 5 digit numeric, must be active in master table. 

Currency – 3 characters, must be active in master table. 

CGL – 10 digit numeric, must be active in master table. 

Amount – must not be 0 and allowed precision is max 16 digits and 4 decimals 

Each record must have indicator for Debit (DR) or Credit (CR). 

The remarks must be alpha-numeric and length between 2-30. 

Product Code – numeric up to 8 digits (Optional). 

